{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925240/extras/bb154304a42bfdc6eefe0fab91b79efa.poster.avif?t=1769194058\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925240/extras/bb154304a42bfdc6eefe0fab91b79efa.webm?t=1769194058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925240/extras/bb154304a42bfdc6eefe0fab91b79efa.mp4?t=1769194058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf10 Otaku Love Story \ud83c\udf10</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABOUT THE GAME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Behind the keyboard, you're a struggling web novelist. In reality, you're a socially anxious shut-in. You thought your destiny was a life spent with writing software, game clients, and video streaming sites... until one fateful day\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your editor, that cute e-girl you follow on the Bluebird App for her spicy pics, your pro-gamer duo, and even that indie Vtuber you donate to... they all start to form real-world connections with you, one after another.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wait... could this be... a lucky break in love?! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simulate the life of a web novelist. Grow from a struggling nobody into a chart-topping, famous author.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Romance four heroines you meet through different online channels. Take your relationship from the chat window to real-life dates and unlock their unique endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full Chinese voice acting for all heroines.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautifully animated character portraits with multiple outfits for each heroine.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925240/extras/9361f614c4ea0e0930eab60d1ffb049d.poster.avif?t=1769194058\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925240/extras/9361f614c4ea0e0930eab60d1ffb049d.webm?t=1769194058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925240/extras/9361f614c4ea0e0930eab60d1ffb049d.mp4?t=1769194058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wenwen</strong> - Your strict editor, the &quot;demoness&quot; who's always chasing you for the next chapter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925240/extras/8e892440bd42c26e27bbfc4fbd2bcfa0.poster.avif?t=1769194058\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925240/extras/8e892440bd42c26e27bbfc4fbd2bcfa0.webm?t=1769194058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925240/extras/8e892440bd42c26e27bbfc4fbd2bcfa0.mp4?t=1769194058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Yuuki</strong> - The &quot;Goddess&quot; on the Bluebird app who blesses your timeline with her alluring photos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925240/extras/da1fe48e0df6cfcc915ad6b8f2cf458b.poster.avif?t=1769194058\